 involved in cerebral cortex development. Component of the MOZ/MORF complex which has a histone H3 acetyltransferase activity."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}